> Happy to help - answers in order:
>
> 1. Site key: MOD-01 is the site key (Modesto), not the line. Line 2 gets its own line key under it. I'd suggest MOD-01/L2, to match what line 1 is effectively using (MOD-01/L1). I can rename the line 1 key on our side if that helps; nothing downstream breaks, history stays attached.
> 2. Exception report: yes, a distribution list works. Settings > Reports > Exception report > Recipients, add ops-modesto@northstarfoods.com. Delivery stays daily at 06:00 your time unless you change it on the same page.
> 3. PO changes: Kim Delgado (kim@tessera.io) handles anything PO or invoice related. I'll give Kim a heads-up that a change is coming from Paul.
>
> Tuesday is fine for the first push from line 2. If Marta's team can send me the tag list by Monday I'll pre-load it so the first batch lands cleanly.
>
> Best,
